  × the `+` append marker is not allowed on a `#null` placeholder
   ╭─[jig.kdl:2:3]
 1 │ foo {
 2 │   +a #null
   ·   ─┬
   ·    ╰── `+` on `#null` placeholder
 3 │ }
   ╰────
  help: `#null` declares a position without emitting; the `+` marker has nothing to emit separately. Drop the `+`, or use a real value (or `#false`) if you wanted suppression
